msgstr "Llave magnética del ascensor obtenida\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_036"
msgid "Lift access denied - key card needed.\n"
msgstr "Acceso al ascensor denegado - llave magnética requerida.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_037"
msgid "Key card accepted - lift operational.\n"
msgstr "Llave magnética aceptada - ascensor operativo.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_038"
msgid "Lift is fully operational.\n"
msgstr "El ascensor está completamente operativo.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_039"
msgid "Hangar has been accessed.\n"
msgstr "Has accedido al hangar.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_040"
msgid "Met up with CI agent.\n"
msgstr "Has encontrado al agente del IC.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_041"
msgid "Air intercept radar shut down.\n"
msgstr "Radar interceptor aéreo apagado.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_042"
msgid "Critical mission object destroyed.\n"
msgstr "Objeto crítico de la misión destruido.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_043"
msgid "Main gate has been opened.\n"
msgstr "La puerta principal ha sido abierta.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_044"
msgid "Main gate has been closed.\n"
msgstr "La puerta principal ha sido cerrada.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_045"
msgid "Access denied.\n"
msgstr "Acceso denegado.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_046"
msgid "Explosive has been placed.\n"
msgstr "El explosivo ha sido colocado.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_047"
msgid "Intruder detected - security system online.\n"
msgstr "Intruso detectado - sistema de seguridad activo.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_048"
msgid "Obtain explosive.\n"
msgstr "Obtén explosivos.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_049"
msgid "Dr. Caroll's\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll:\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_050"
msgid "Explosives\n"
msgstr "Explosivos\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_051"
msgid "Explosives\n"
msgstr "Explosivos\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_052"
msgid "Picked up explosives.\n"
msgstr "Explosivos obtenidos.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_053"
msgid ""
"The air intercept radar is controlled from that \n"
"bunker.\n"
msgstr ""
"El radar interceptor aéreo es controlado desde \n"
"ese búnker.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_054"
msgid ""
"There's the antenna, but... I can't throw a bug \n"
"that high!\n"
msgstr ""
"Ahí está la antena, pero... ¡no puedo lanzar un \n"
"'bicho' a esa altura!\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_055"
msgid ""
"The hangar lift is on the other side \n"
"of that huge door.\n"
msgstr ""
"El ascensor del hangar está al otro lado \n"
"de esa gran puerta.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_056"
msgid ""
"Careful with that trigger finger, Agent Dark - \n"
"you're closing in on my position.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cuidado con el dedo en el gatillo, Agente Dark. Te estás acercando a mi "
"posición.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_057"
msgid "Lift access terminals destroyed.\n"
msgstr "Terminales de acceso del ascensor destruidos.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_058"
msgid ""
"Okay, Joanna, take a look at this. Our \n"
"operative inside Area 51 was able to get \n"
"this out to us.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vale, Joanna, echa un vistazo a esto. \n"
"Nuestro agente en el Área 51 fue capaz \n"
"de sacar esto para nosotros.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_059"
msgid ""
"This is your entry point... A deserted helipad \n"
"on the edge of the base.\n"
msgstr ""
"Éste es tu punto de entrada. Un helipuerto \n"
"desierto en el borde de la base.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_060"
msgid ""
"The lift down to the hangars and the \n"
"rendezvous point is beyond that wall... \n"
"Watch out for these guards.\n"
msgstr ""
"El ascensor que baja a los hangares y el \n"
"punto de encuentro están detrás de ese \n"
"muro... Cuidado con esos guardas.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_061"
msgid ""
"Here is the communications antenna. \n"
"Attach a comms rider bug so we can talk to \n"
"you when you're inside the base. Again, \n"
"watch out for hostiles.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aquí está la antena de comunicaciones. \n"
"Coloca un 'bicho' para que podamos contactar \n"
"cuando estés dentro de la base. De nuevo, \n"
"cuidado con el personal hostil.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_062"
msgid "Oh, my God!\n"
msgstr "¡Oh, Dios mío!\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_063"
msgid ""
"Here is our friend. He appears to be \n"
"physically unhurt, though he hasn't \n"
"regained consciousness yet. By the look \n"
"of it, the surgeons are almost done with \n"
"their preliminary tests and will begin \n"
"dissection soon.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aquí está nuestro amigo. Parece que no \n"
"está físicamente dañado, aunque no ha \n"
"recuperado la consciencia todavía. Por lo \n"
"que parece, los cirujanos casi han hecho \n"
"sus pruebas preliminares y comenzarán \n"
"pronto con la disección.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_064"
msgid "But who was...?\n"
msgstr "¿Pero qué es...?\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_065"
msgid ""
"Any questions? No. Good. Away you go to \n"
"the hangar.\n"
msgstr ""
"¿Alguna pregunta? No. Bien. Después \n"
"irás al hangar.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_066"
msgid ""
"Agent Dark Mission Log, 1028 hours. Against \n"
"my better judgement, I'm about to enter \n"
"Area 51.\n"
msgstr ""
"Informe de Misión del Agente Dark, 10:28 horas. \n"
"Contra mi mejor juicio, estoy a punto de \n"
"entrar en el Área 51.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_067"
msgid "Agent Dark! Over here!\n"
msgstr "¡Agente Dark! ¡Aquí!\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_068"
msgid ""
"There you are! I was beginning to wonder \n"
"if...\n"
msgstr ""
"¡Aquí estás! Estaba empezando a \n"
"preguntarme si...\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_069"
msgid "If what?\n"
msgstr "¿Si qué?\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_070"
msgid ""
"If you'd been discovered yet. And frankly, \n"
"if this is how you work, I'm amazed that \n"
"you lasted longer than five minutes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Si habías sido descubierto ya. Y francamente, \n"
"si así es como trabajas, estoy asombrada de \n"
"que hayas sobrevivido más de cinco minutos.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_071"
msgid "I was tidying up one of your loose ends.\n"
msgstr "Estaba atando uno de tus cabos sueltos.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_072"
msgid "My loose ends?\n"
msgstr "¿Mis cabos sueltos?\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_073"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, I didn't realize you wanted him \n"
"to shoot you. I can call in some more guards \n"
"if you like.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lo siento, no pensaba que quisieras que él \n"
"te disparara. Puedo llamar a más guardas \n"
"si tú quieres...\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_074"
msgid ""
"Okay, okay, forget about it. I'm going to let \n"
"the Institute know we've made contact.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vale, vale, olvídalo. Voy a hacer saber al \n"
"Instituto que hemos contactado.\n"

msgctxt "L_LUE_075"
msgid "Foreign object detected - security alerted.\n"
msgstr "Objeto extraño detectado - seguridad alertada.\n"
